  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Abusive; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a woman being held at gunpoint by a masked assailant, with the text 'don't move and give me your money' overlaid. This visual and textual combination creates a direct, threatening scenario that simulates a robbery. The intent is to portray a violent, coercive act, which is inherently abusive. The scene is designed to evoke fear and simulate a real-world criminal threat, making it a clear example of abusive content as it threatens and intimidates the viewer or subject. There is no targeting of specific protected groups, but the content is harmful and potentially traumatizing due to its violent nature. The meme uses the juxtaposition of the image (a vulnerable person being threatened) with the text (a direct command to surrender money) to create a sense of immediacy and danger, fulfilling an abusive intent.",
